text:
Verse 11. Unto the maker thereof-"To him that hath disposed this"] That is, to God the Author and Disposer of this visitation, the invasion with which he now threatens you. The very same expressions are applied to God, and upon the same occasion,  Isaiah 37:26 :-  



    "Hast thou not heard of old, that I have disposed it; 
     And of ancient times, that I have formed it?"
